abilities.text:
Innervate
(D)
Malfurion
Cooldown: 25 seconds
Grant an allied Hero 20% of their maximum Mana over 5 seconds. While affected by Innervate, their Basic Ability cooldowns recharge 50% faster.
Cannot be used on Heroes that do not use Mana.
Innervate is a Trait that can be used to make an allied Hero restore
some Mana over time and, more importantly, give them cooldown reduction
on Basic Abilities. When used at the right time and on the right Heroes,
this effect can turn the fight in your favor.
The best targets need Basic Abilites with a relatively short cooldown
(usable multiple times while under Innervate), multiple ways to get value
from them (mobility, survivability, damage, waveclear, crowd control),
or Heroes who need more Mana to stay on the battlefield for longer.
The best Heroes for casting Innervate on are:
Artanis;
Chromie;
Gul'dan;
Jaina;
Li-Ming;
Maiev;
Malthael;
Medivh;
Mephisto;
Orphea;
Tassadar.
